  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a tandoor or oven to 200°C.",
    "Spread the halved artichokes on a sheet and drizzle with 1 tablespoon of oil, then roast for 15 minutes, turning halfway through.",
    "While the artichokes roast, heat the remaining oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger and sauté until fragrant and the onion is translucent.",
    "Stir in tomato paste and let it caramelize for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and honey, then add soy sauce, dried mint, and dill; bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the roasted artichokes to the sauce and simmer gently for 15 minutes, allowing the flavors to meld.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, optionally garnished with fresh herbs or a drizzle of cream."
  ],
